                                "example_id": "39ddcaf7-1e1d-478d-9631-b59d3c16f299",
                                "sense_id": "176af53e-30be-305d-84c8-0716de5a03ae",
                                "text": "Her look, her attitude, her words were eloquent of the age-old appeal of defenseless woman to her natural protector—man."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "500f279b-040a-4bb6-ba00-b774e46fed3f",
                                "sense_id": "176af53e-30be-305d-84c8-0716de5a03ae",
                                "text": "On the port tack layline , you're defenseless against starboard tackers — you have to dip them , no matter how much you may lose doing it — and the wind shadow of boats spinnakering away from the mark can cost you plenty."
                            }
                        ]
